# Lightning Bolt of its own, paid with the Mox Ruby it left untapped, and Bot1 loses. The game goes on (Bot2 and Bot3 remain),
# and Bot1's Bolt is gone with its owner, as is every card Bot1 owned: Bot2 is still at 20 and Bot1's graveyard is empty.

